Python source code and numerical datasets used to reproduce the results reported in the manuscript. The package includes implementations for the Sierpiński-gasket and diamond hierarchical networks, projected-memory calculations, spectral-weight scaling, cumulative spectral-measure analysis, and the intermediate-support \(\sigma=1/2\) falsification test. CSV files contain the numerical results used in the manuscript and Supplementary Material. A README and requirements file provide instructions for reproducing the calculations.
